{# Reflect handoff. The reflection prompt itself lives in the tool's Sheet, never
   here: two copies drift the first time one is reworded. The tool's URL never
   appears in this repo; it lives on the Classroom Material only.
   Fill "reflection-journal" in src/_data/classroomLinks.json (August) and the
   button goes live on every block page at once. #}
<div class="reflect-callout">
  <p>Today's reflection is in Google Classroom, under Reflection Journal.</p>
  {% if classroomLinks["reflection-journal"] %}
  <a href="{{ classroomLinks['reflection-journal'] }}" class="rubric-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Reflection Journal</a>
  {% else %}
  <span class="rubric-link-pending">Link posted in August</span>
  {% endif %}
</div>
<p class="reflect-note">Sign in with your school account. Your teacher can see what you write here.</p>
